{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guardian of Altai</strong> is an atmospheric adventure inspired by the myths and spirits of ancient Altai.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a shaman \u2014 the last guardian of balance between worlds. Channel the power of the elements, beat your ritual drum, and fight back the darkness that has covered the land. Your journey will take you deep into the underworld to save what remains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world where every sound and symbol pulses with ancient magic. Free the trapped spirits, defeat the spawn of Erlik, and restore harmony before it\u2019s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896760/extras/f76e7e8c54dc36831c70f4b87736902d.poster.avif?t=1754921874\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896760/extras/f76e7e8c54dc36831c70f4b87736902d.webm?t=1754921874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896760/extras/f76e7e8c54dc36831c70f4b87736902d.mp4?t=1754921874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles with mythical creatures and shamanic magic in action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A diegetic interface \u2014 nothing on screen but the ritual</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy yurt\u2026 and a purring cat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ethno-fantasy visual style and atmospheric soundtracks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s